<title>FINLAND: S.HELASTO SEES FULL-YEAR EARNINGS RISING.</title>
<headline>S.HELASTO SEES FULL-YEAR EARNINGS RISING.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish safety equipment maker Suomen Helasto Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it expected full-year 1996/1997 profit to be above the 1995/1996 level.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's full-year turnover is expected to be around 125 million markka and profit is seen exceeding the level of the previous financial period,&quot; Suomen Helasto said in a statement with its results for the six months period to end-April.</p>
<p>The group's full-year net sales to end-October 1996 were 102.4 million markka and profit after financial items was 7.1 million.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
